unty&rsquo;s 6 grids in Anson County has 75 years on record, and October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 39% of normal in November to December and 166% in April to May. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 19% of normal on the middle. Grid 17900 had its driest year in 2001 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
